# myecho Project Rules

Read `AGENTS.md` before making changes. Follow its repository map, commands, and development rules.

Keep Go changes scoped to the existing package boundaries:

- API handlers and validators stay under `handler/api`.
- View handlers stay under `handler/view`.
- Business logic stays under `service`.
- Persistence logic stays under `dal` and `model`.
- Templates and public assets stay under `views`.

Run `make fmt` after editing Go files and `make test` when the change affects backend behavior.
